    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061107.0113\n\nJAKARTA, Nov. 7 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nIndonesian shares extend gain\n\n\n\n\nShare prices on the Jakarta Stock Exchange ended higher Tuesday after the central bank announced further cut of the benchmark rate to continue making record.\n\nThe index rose by 13.3 points to close at 1,654.15 points.\n\nTurnovers totaled 2.3 billion shares worth 2.5 trillion rupiah (274.6 million U.S. dollars).\n\nLosers led gainers 69 to 55, with 91 other issues left unchanged.",
